--- This file defines the persistent object class.  Other storage files import it,
--- so it stays loaded even when the persistent object APIs are left out.

--- This module defines PersistObj class that models the persistent object of the G.P. documentation.

--- @kind state
--- @feature persistent
omod PERSISTENT-OBJECT is
  pr OBJECT-ID .
  pr TRUSTED-STORAGE-OBJECT .
  pr FILE-ID .
  pr STORAGE-IDENTIFER .
  pr LIST{Data} .

--- The persistent object class.  The data stream is embedded in the object as a list of data fragments.
  class PersistObj | file-name : FileName , data-stream : List{Data} .
  subclass PersistObj < CryptoObj .

endom
